{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48395","headline":"判僧云晏五人聚赌喧诤语 · 韩滉","name":"判僧云晏五人聚赌喧诤语","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"正法何曾执贝，空门不积余财。\n白日既能赌博，通宵必醉尊罍。\n强说天堂难到，又言地狱长开。\n竝付江神收管，波中便是泉台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩滉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48395.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48395","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}